      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VELVET LEGEND (2) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when second (17.18) over 300m at this track. Got the money at her only try from this box. Can measure up this time. INVICTUS TOMMY (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.21) at this track behind How It's Done in a Grade 6. Has the pace to be prominent. Must be included in calculations. GIGGLIN' (7) boasts a consistent overall record including three wins from 14 starts, but missed the frame latest when fourth (35.26) over 595m at Angle Park. Will go close here with a clear run. BUFFY'S NO ANGEL (1) warrants respect although new to this track.",
